# ── what is committed, and what is not ────────────────────────────────────
#
#   ipynb/      COMMITTED. The notebooks, rendered, and nothing else.
#   src/        COMMITTED. paths.R: locations only.
#   genes/      COMMITTED. Curated gene sets.
#   run_all.sh, README.md, endotypes-transcriptomics.yml   COMMITTED.
#
#   data/       NOT committed. Downloads, and data/run_artifacts/, which a run regenerates.
#   figures/    NOT committed. A PNG of every figure; a run regenerates them.

data/
figures/
endotypes-transcriptomics.tar.gz

# ipynb/ holds notebooks. Anything else that lands there is a stray.
ipynb/*.csv
ipynb/*.rds
ipynb/*.png
ipynb/*.pdf
ipynb/*.html
ipynb/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# macOS
.DS_Store
